// ==========================================================================
// Transport & Vehicle Operations (Phase 1) — manages ONLY the physical
// movement of vehicles and dispatch execution; never writes InventoryLedger
// or journal_entries itself. Stock Transfer dispatches call the EXISTING
// postDispatch() (src/lib/warehouse/dispatch.ts); Customer dispatches call
// the EXISTING createSaleTx() (src/lib/sales/createSale.ts) — see
// src/lib/transport/dispatchExecution.ts, the shared docType-discriminated
// engine. New models here deliberately use plain tenantId/businessId/branchId
// (no explicit Tenant relation) to match the high-volume operational-table
// convention (e.g. StockAllocationLot), except DispatchConfiguration which
// mirrors the PurchaseSetting singleton-config pattern.
// ==========================================================================

